                <Section Tag="File format reference">
                    <Paragraph Style="{StaticResource H1}">File format reference</Paragraph>
                    <Paragraph>
                        A <Run Style="{StaticResource Code}">.ribbon</Run> file is XML: a root <Run Style="{StaticResource Code}">&lt;tab&gt;</Run>,
                        then panels and panes, then the structures below. Attribute names are lower-case. Every attribute an element supports
                        should be present, empty if unused; the editor always writes all of them. The format has no XSD: it is exactly what
                        <Run Style="{StaticResource Code}">RibbonBuilder.cs</Run> parses, and the editor's schema table is kept in sync with it by a test.
                    </Paragraph>
                    <Table>
                        <Table.Columns>
                            <TableColumn Width="2*" />
                            <TableColumn Width="6*" />
                            <TableColumn Width="4*" />
                        </Table.Columns>
                        <TableRowGroup>
                            <TableRow>
                                <TableCell Style="{StaticResource Th}"><Paragraph>Element</Paragraph></TableCell>
                                <TableCell Style="{StaticResource Th}"><Paragraph>Attributes (* required)</Paragraph></TableCell>
                                <TableCell Style="{StaticResource Th}"><Paragraph>Allowed children</Paragraph></TableCell>
                            </TableRow>
                            <TableRow><TableCell><Paragraph>tab</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>name*</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>panel, dockablepane</Paragraph></TableCell></TableRow>
                            <TableRow><TableCell><Paragraph>dockablepane</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>name*, guid*, title, classname*, startshidden</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>none (3.1+)</Paragraph></TableCell></TableRow>
                            <TableRow><TableCell><Paragraph>panel</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>name*</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>separator, stackeditems, splitbuttons, slideoutpanel, radiobuttons</Paragraph></TableCell></TableRow>
                            <TableRow><TableCell><Paragraph>separator</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>(none)</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>none</Paragraph></TableCell></TableRow>
                            <TableRow><TableCell><Paragraph>stackeditems</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>(none)</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>1 to 3 of: button, pulldownbuttons, combobox, textbox</Paragraph></TableCell></TableRow>
                            <TableRow><TableCell><Paragraph>splitbuttons</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>(none)</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>button</Paragraph></TableCell></TableRow>
                            <TableRow><TableCell><Paragraph>slideoutpanel</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>name</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>button</Paragraph></TableCell></TableRow>
                            <TableRow><TableCell><Paragraph>radiobuttons</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>name*</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>togglebutton</Paragraph></TableCell></TableRow>
                            <TableRow><TableCell><Paragraph>button</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>name*, classname*, text*, tooltip, image, largeimage, tooltipimage, contexthelp</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>none</Paragraph></TableCell></TableRow>
                            <TableRow><TableCell><Paragraph>pulldownbuttons</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>name*, image*</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>button</Paragraph></TableCell></TableRow>
                            <TableRow><TableCell><Paragraph>combobox</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>name*, itemtext, longdescription, tooltip, tooltipimage</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>comboboxmember</Paragraph></TableCell></TableRow>
                            <TableRow><TableCell><Paragraph>comboboxmember</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>name*, text*, image, groupname</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>none</Paragraph></TableCell></TableRow>
                            <TableRow><TableCell><Paragraph>textbox</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>name*, prompttext, longdescription, image, showimage, tooltip, tooltipimage</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>none</Paragraph></TableCell></TableRow>
                            <TableRow><TableCell><Paragraph>togglebutton</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>name*, text*, tooltip, largeimage</Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell><Paragraph>none</Paragraph></TableCell></TableRow>
                        </TableRowGroup>
                    </Table>
                    <Paragraph Style="{StaticResource H2}">Example</Paragraph>
                    <Paragraph Style="{StaticResource CodeBlock}" xml:space="preserve">&lt;?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?&gt;
&lt;!-- Version 2.3.0 2026-10-09 --&gt;
&lt;tab name="ENG Mechanical"&gt;
  &lt;dockablepane name="ACCODocsLibrary" guid="ACC0D0C5-11B2-4A2B-9E77-3F1A6C5B2D41"
                title="ACCO Link Library"
                classname="RevitRibbon_MainSourceCode_Resources.Forms.LinkLibrary_Pane"
                startshidden="true" /&gt;
  &lt;panel name="Tools"&gt;
    &lt;stackeditems&gt;
      &lt;button name="btn_ACCODocs"
              classname="RevitRibbon_MainSourceCode.Unique_Button_Classes.Mechanical.Cmd_ACCODocs"
              text="ACCO Docs&#10;Library"
              tooltip="" image="C:\...\Images\ACCODocs_16x16.png"
              largeimage="C:\...\Images\ACCODocs_32x32.png"
              tooltipimage="C:\...\Images\ACCODocs_192x192.png"
              contexthelp="" /&gt;
    &lt;/stackeditems&gt;
  &lt;/panel&gt;
&lt;/tab&gt;</Paragraph>
                    <Paragraph Style="{StaticResource H2}">Rules worth knowing</Paragraph>
                    <List>
                        <ListItem><Paragraph>Item names must be unique within a panel; panel names unique within the tab; pane names unique per file.</Paragraph></ListItem>
                        <ListItem><Paragraph>Captions and tooltips may contain real line breaks inside the quotes. Never reformat the file with a tool that collapses them.</Paragraph></ListItem>
                        <ListItem><Paragraph>A comment that holds exactly one element is a disabled item; any other comment inside the tab is dropped on load (with a warning).</Paragraph></ListItem>
                        <ListItem><Paragraph>Revit loads only the first <Run Style="{StaticResource Code}">.ribbon</Run> it finds next to the DLL. Keep one per folder.</Paragraph></ListItem>
                        <ListItem><Paragraph>Problems the builder finds at startup are listed once in a "Ribbon XML problems" dialog in Revit; the rest of the tab is still built.</Paragraph></ListItem>
                    </List>
                </Section>

